        <defaultValue>false</defaultValue>
        <description>Indicates if this Offering has been created by an ODM (Original Device Manufacturer) Partner. This flag is set when the Offering is created.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Indicates if this Offering has been created by an ODM (Original Device Manufacturer) Partner. This flag is set when the Offering is created.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Is ODM</label>
